OL,3,CFundraiser for Jason Arday's family
OL,4,Cpasses #30,000
OL,6,FA fundraiser for the family of former
OL,7,FCambridge professor Jason Arday has
OL,8,Ftopped #30,000.
OL,10,FProf Arday had resigned from his post
OL,11,Fas the professor of sociology of
OL,12,Feducation last week after allegations
OL,13,Fof plagiarism were made against him.
OL,15,FHe was pronounced dead after emergency
OL,16,Fservices were called to an address in
OL,17,FBattersea, south London, on Friday
OL,18,Ffollowing reports that a man had been
OL,19,Ffound unresponsive inside a property.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
