CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786949274
OL,3,CFundraiser for Jason Arday's family
OL,4,Cpasses #30,000
OL,6,FThe GoFundMe fundraiser launched by
OL,7,FWindrush campaigner Sir Patrick Vernon
OL,8,Fon Saturday afternoon passed #30,000
OL,9,Fearly on Sunday morning.
OL,11,FMore than 1,100 donations had been
OL,12,Freceived as the fund reached 60% of
OL,13,Fits #50,000 target.
OL,15,FWriting on the crowdfunder's webpage,
OL,16,FSir Patrick paid tribute to the
OL,17,F"pioneering" academic.
OL,26,@yD@AOUyD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
