PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786949274
OL,3,CFundraiser for Jason Arday's family
OL,4,Cpasses #30,000
OL,6,FHe said: "I was one of the people who
OL,7,Fpublicly supported Jason during the
OL,8,Frecent controversy because I was
OL,9,Fdeeply concerned about the nature and
OL,10,Fintensity of the attacks directed
OL,11,Ftowards him.
OL,13,F"I was also subject to media scrutiny
OL,14,Ffor signing the letter of support and
OL,15,Fchallenged in supporting Jason.
OL,17,F"Following his death, my immediate
OL,18,Fconcern is now for Jason's family.
OL,26,@nD@JOUuD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786949274
OL,3,CFundraiser for Jason Arday's family
OL,4,Cpasses #30,000
OL,6,F"I am therefore establishing this fund
OL,7,Fto help contribute towards funeral,
OL,8,Fmemorial and associated family costs
OL,9,Fand to provide practical support
OL,10,Fduring an unimaginably difficult
OL,11,Fperiod."
OL,13,FThe organisation Stand Up To Racism
OL,14,Fhas announced plans for a vigil in
OL,15,FProf Arday's memory.
OL,17,FIt will be held on the steps of the
OL,18,FNational Gallery in Trafalgar Square,
OL,19,Fcentral London, at 6pm on Monday.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
