OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786949274
OL,3,CFundraiser for Jason Arday's family
OL,4,Cpasses #30,000
OL,6,FThe group's co-convenor, Weyman
OL,7,FBennett, said in a statement: "Jason
OL,8,FArday's death is a tragedy ` but make
OL,9,Fno mistake, it was the result of a
OL,10,Fracist witch hunt.
OL,12,F"For more than a week, the right-wing
OL,13,Fpress, politicians and the far right
OL,14,Fhave hounded Jason with the most
OL,15,Fvicious racism.
OL,17,F"They are spreading the far right lie
OL,18,Fthat black people are only appointed
OL,19,Fbecause of the colour of our skin,
OL,20,Frather than our ability.
OL,26,@oD@_OUtD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786949274
OL,3,CFundraiser for Jason Arday's family
OL,4,Cpasses #30,000
OL,6,F"They have blood on their hands. Our
OL,7,Fthoughts are with Jason's family, but
OL,8,Fwe are furious with those who are to
OL,9,Fblame. Enough is enough."
OL,11,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham described
OL,12,Fthe professor's death as a "tragedy"
OL,13,Fand called for a "moment of
OL,14,Freflection".
OL,16,FMr Burnham told reporters during a
OL,17,Fvisit to Cornwall: "It's a tragedy on
OL,18,Fso many levels, but particularly just
OL,19,Ffor everybody who knew Jason, his
OL,20,Ffamily obviously, his friends. We
OL,21,Fthink of think of them today.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@YO]tD@\OUtD@dO]uD@ROUvD@KO]yD@
OL,26,ATOU
