FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786949274
OL,3,CFundraiser for Jason Arday's family
OL,4,Cpasses #30,000
OL,6,F"It's not a moment for any rushing to
OL,7,Fjudgment. It's a moment for
OL,8,Freflection, I would say, reflecting on
OL,9,Fhow things came to this.
OL,11,F"A really sad, sad and sorry state of
OL,12,Faffairs and I think we all today think
OL,13,Fof Jason, his contribution, and his
OL,14,Ffamily and friends."
OL,16,FIn the hours before he died, Prof
OL,17,FArday told University of Cambridge
OL,18,Fprofessor, and director of the Autism
OL,19,FResearch Centre, Sir Simon Baron-Cohen
OL,20,Fthat he "couldn't go on".
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUvD@TO]|D@IOU|D@XO]
