PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786949274
OL,3,CFundraiser for Jason Arday's family
OL,4,Cpasses #30,000
OL,6,FSir Simon told the BBC: "He was being
OL,7,Fsubjected to relentless scrutiny,
OL,8,Fincluding ridicule, discrediting
OL,9,Fabsolutely every detail of his life,
OL,10,Fand he wasn't coping with the loss of
OL,11,Fhis career, the loss of his
OL,12,Freputation, and he felt he couldn't go
OL,13,Fon."
OL,26,@nD@YOUuD@DO]
