PN,31309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786949274
OL,3,CFundraiser for Jason Arday's family
OL,4,Cpasses #30,000
OL,6,FIn a statement issued by his publisher
OL,7,FSimon & Schuster UK on Friday, Prof
OL,8,FArday's family said: "Jason was
OL,9,Fsubjected to a campaign of sustained
OL,10,Fabuse for the more than three years
OL,11,Fsince he accepted the role of
OL,12,Fprofessor at Cambridge University by
OL,13,Fthose who would leave no stone
OL,14,Funturned in their quest to undermine
OL,15,Fhim.
OL,17,F"The campaign of misinformation was
OL,18,Ftoo much for Jason, who was a gentle
OL,19,Fman and who always wanted to see the
OL,20,Fbest in everyone.
OL,26,@pD@VOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786949274
OL,3,CFundraiser for Jason Arday's family
OL,4,Cpasses #30,000
OL,6,F"We are in shock to have lost this
OL,7,Famazing father, partner, brother,
OL,8,Funcle and son.
OL,10,F"We won't comment further at this
OL,11,Fpoint beyond asking the press to leave
OL,12,Fus alone now, and to stop the campaign
OL,13,Fof harassment which has been waged
OL,14,Fagainst Jason and his family for too
OL,15,Flong."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUwD@FO]
